# --- added when the GUI moved into this repo -------------------------------------
# The Tauri target/ is routinely 1-5 GB. src-tauri/.gitignore already covers it where
# it actually lives; these catch it at the gui/ root too, plus the bundles `tauri build`
# produces. The accident being prevented is one `git add gui/` that stages gigabytes.
target/
gen/

# Bundled applications and installers — build artifacts, not source.
*.app
*.dmg
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.msi
